# The same open string 0 at the six dynamic levels pp..ff (synthetic nail speed and
# slip-off force placeholders from default_performance_settings()).
title One note at six dynamic levels
status synthetic demonstration; not a transcription of a performance or a validated gesture
pluck @0.10 string=0 dyn=pp
pluck @1.30 string=0 dyn=p
pluck @2.50 string=0 dyn=mp
pluck @3.70 string=0 dyn=mf
pluck @4.90 string=0 dyn=f
pluck @6.10 string=0 dyn=ff
end @8.0
